hapisho la sasa','Processing…'=>'Inashughulikiwa…','Failed. Please try again.'=>'Imeshindwa. Tafadhali jaribu tena.','Request failed. Check your connection.'=>'Ombi limeshindwa. Angalia muunganisho wako.','Apply to Footnote'=>'Tumia kwa Nukuu','Quick Translate'=>'Tafsiri Haraka','Paste text, or select text in the editor first…'=>'Bandika maandishi, au chagua maandishi kwenye mhariri kwanza…','Clear input'=>'Futa ingizo','Clear'=>'Futa','Instructions / key points'=>'Maagizo / vidokezo muhimu','Describe what to write — topic, key points, structure…'=>'Eleza kinachopaswa kuandikwa — mada, vidokezo muhimu, muundo…','Language (optional)'=>'Lugha (hiari)','— auto-detect —'=>'— kugundua kiotomatiki —','Generate'=>'Tengeneza','Clear hints'=>'Futa vidokezo','Clear All'=>'Futa Yote','Refine further — e.g. "make it shorter" or "use a formal tone"…'=>'Boresha zaidi — mfano "fupisha" au "tumia sauti rasmi"…','Please enter some text first…'=>'Tafadhali ingiza maandishi kwanza…','Please enter some instructions first…'=>'Tafadhali ingiza maagizo kwanza…','Request failed. Please try again.'=>'Ombi limeshindwa. Tafadhali jaribu tena.','Tone:'=>'Sauti:','Language:'=>'Lugha:','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Lingua Forge AI Tools'=>'Vifaa vya Lingua Forge AI','Close popover'=>'Funga kidirisha','Paste text, or select text on the page first…'=>'Bandika maandishi, au chagua maandishi kwenye ukurasa kwanza…','Result will appear here…'=>'Matokeo yataonekana hapa…','↺ Re-translate'=>'↺ Tafsiri tena','Notice settings'=>'Mipangilio ya arifa','Notice message'=>'Ujumbe wa arifa','Shown when no translation exists for the visitor\'s language.'=>'Unaonyeshwa wakati hakuna tafsiri inayopo kwa lugha ya mgeni.','Show home link'=>'Onyesha kiungo cha nyumbani','Adds a link to the home page so visitors can browse in their language.'=>'Ongeza kiungo cha ukurasa wa nyumbani ili wageni waweze kuvinjari kwa lugha yao.','Home link text'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo cha nyumbani','block titleMissing Translation Notice'=>'Arifa ya Tafsiri Iliyokosewa','block descriptionRenders a polite notice when the current page is being shown in its source language because no translation exists for the visitor\'s language. Driven by the Lingua Forge router\'s LINGUAFORGE_LANG_FALLBACK_ACTIVE signal — emits nothing when a translation exists for the request locale.'=>'Huonyesha arifa ya heshima wakati ukurasa wa sasa unaonyeshwa kwa lugha yake ya asili kwa sababu hakuna tafsiri inayopo kwa lugha ya mgeni. Inasababishwa na ishara ya LINGUAFORGE_LANG_FALLBACK_ACTIVE ya mtaalamu wa Lingua Forge — haitoi chochote wakati kuna tafsiri kwa eneo la ombi.','block keywordlanguage'=>'lugha','block keywordtranslation'=>'tafsiri','block keywordfallback'=>'kuzingatia','block keywordi18n'=>'i18n','block keywordlinguaforge'=>'linguaforge']];